  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1rem; line-height: var(--body-font-line-height); font-size: calc(var(--large-text-size-value) * 1rem); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); transition-property: opacity; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 'Space Mono'; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(9, 62, 4); text-align: center; transition-timing-function: ease; transition-duration: 0.65s; transition-delay: 0.136646s; animation-duration: 0.65s; opacity: 1;\" class=\"sqsrte-large preFade fadeIn\">Camping Platform: Comfortable Sleep &amp; Ample Storage</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 1rem 0px; line-height: var(--body-font-line-height); font-size: calc(var(--large-text-size-value) * 1rem); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); transition-property: opacity; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 'Space Mono'; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(9, 62, 4); text-align: center; transition-timing-function: ease; transition-duration: 0.65s; transition-delay: 0.142857s; animation-duration: 0.65s; opacity: 1;\" class=\"sqsrte-large preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\" data-text-attribute-id=\"5c438e84-451f-44d5-ab06-a136872bde61\" class=\"sqsrte-text-highlight\">Tesla Model <strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Y</strong> / <strong style=\"font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">S / X</strong> / 3</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 1rem 0px 0px; line-height: var(--body-font-line-height); font-size: calc(var(--large-text-size-value) * 1rem); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); transition-property: opacity; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: 'Space Mono'; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(9, 62, 4); text-align: center; transition-timing-function: ease; transition-duration: 0.65s; transition-delay: 0.149068s; animation-duration: 0.65s; opacity: 1;\" class=\"sqsrte-large preFade fadeIn\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\" data-text-attribute-id=\"71ed92a2-3a34-4558-b286-5fc27bd77495\" class=\"sqsrte-text-highlight\">any other car</span></p>\r\n<h2>Restore in the Wild</h2>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>Nomad every weekend - visit new places, meet friends, attend festivals and much much more&hellip;</p>\r\n<p>You'll be happy to say goodbye to the tent, especially on a rainy day.</p>\r\n<p>Designed with care for both you and nature, it's made from eco-friendly&nbsp;<strong>FSC-certified&nbsp;</strong>wood.</p>\r\n<p>We are&nbsp;proud that our workshop&nbsp;is powered&nbsp;by electricity from&nbsp;<strong>100% renewable sources</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>Plus, we can&nbsp;<strong>customize</strong>&nbsp;it to fit any car, blending smart design with sustainability and convenience.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2>Main features</h2>\r\n<div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Quick setting up of flat full-length bed</li>\r\n<li>No need for car alteration</li>\r\n<li>Easy access to extra storage space underneath</li>\r\n<li>Extended in the shoulder area</li>\r\n<li>Two coffee tables</li>\r\n<li>Optional drawer with sink</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: 368px;\" src=\"https://bdc49c-a5.myshopify.com/cdn/shop/files/Camping_platform_with_drewer.gif?v=1726041336&amp;width=750\" width=\"546\" height=\"500\" alt=\"PRO camping platform\"></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
